  "pli-tv-pvr11:60.3": "In the Pali, the word <i lang='pi' translate='no'>āpatti</i>/<i lang='pi' translate='no'>samāpatti</i> means both “attainment” and “offense”. The Pali is a play on words, which is impossible to replicate in English. ",
